@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F9FAFB
skinparam classBorderColor #344054
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
title Respond to browser capabilities and viewport
actor "Participant or administrator" as user
box "Frontend - Client or admin application" #E0F2FE
participant "AppShell / feature page" as page
participant "IBrowserCapabilityService" as capabilities
participant "Presentation components" as presentation
end box
user -> page : Open or resize screen [L2-034/035]
page -> capabilities : Read capability signals
capabilities --> page : Motion, GPU and audio state
page -> presentation : Token layout for current CSS viewport
alt Reduced motion or unavailable GPU
presentation --> user : Static saved result / text fallback [L2-037]
else Supported motion
presentation --> user : Bounded optional animation
end
user -> capabilities : Deliberately enable then mute sound
capabilities -> presentation : Enable only if permitted; stop immediately on mute
presentation --> user : Same result in every capability state
note over page
Verify ten widths, 200% zoom, software keyboard,
all applicable states and actual Chrome version.
end note
@enduml
